<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Sowits to appeal judgement,cautions holders.</title>
<headline>Sowits to appeal judgement,cautions holders.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African mine Southern Witwatersrand Exploration Co Ltd (Sowits) said on Tuesday it would appeal against the recent judgement regarding Black Wattle Colliery.</p>
<p>It also said talks it announced early this month were still in progress and could impact on its share price.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to exercise caution in their sharedealings.</p>
<p>No further details were given in a brief announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
